# REQUIREMENTS — <project>

The official task text, **verbatim**, with one id per independently checkable
obligation. This file is the source; `REQUIREMENT_COVERAGE.md` is the register
that tracks it. Never paraphrase here — paraphrase is where a requirement
quietly narrows, and the coverage gate cannot detect a narrowing that happened
before the register was written.

Ids are `R1`, `R2`, … `R12a` where one sentence carries two obligations. They
are anchored: `validate_requirement_coverage.py` matches `^(R\d+[a-z]?)$`, so
prose cannot contribute one.

